Affected: scripts/utils/common_utils.sh (EVAL), unica/patches/bluetooth/customize.sh, unica/patches/legacy/customize.sh.
Verify: binary-extraction-checks.json: EVAL failure visible with errexit; actual legacy payload matches boot-header bytes; invalid/truncated input rejected; actual Bluetooth block ELF hash/metadata matches APEX; original BOOT and selected DS-ACK hashes unchanged. bash -n and git diff --check.
Rollback: reverse this patch and regenerate partial work_dir. This only extracts/inspects existing binaries; no kernel build/version/payload modification.

